
# Railway Management System

A web-based Railway Management System developed using PHP, MySQL, XAMPP, and phpMyAdmin. The system manages train schedules, passenger bookings, and railway operations efficiently.

## Technologies Used
- PHP
- MySQL
- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript
- XAMPP
- phpMyAdmin

## Features
- Train Search
- Ticket Booking
- Passenger Management
- Train Schedule Management
- Seat Availability Checking

